  "description": "<p>The following SPARQL query creates duplicate date propeties on NonRdfSourceDescriptions:</p>\n\n<p>DELETE WHERE</p>\n{\r\n&lt;&gt; &lt;http://www.loc.gov/premis/rdf/v1#hasDateCreatedByApplication&gt; ?o0 .\r\n&lt;&gt; &lt;http://www.loc.gov/premis/rdf/v1#hasEventDateTime&gt; ?o1 .\r\n}\n<p> ;<br/>\nINSERT DATA </p>\n{\r\n&lt;&gt; &lt;http://www.loc.gov/premis/rdf/v1#hasDateCreatedByApplication&gt; \"2015-01-27T19:09:18.112Z\"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; .\r\n&lt;&gt; &lt;http://www.loc.gov/premis/rdf/v1#hasEventDateTime&gt; \"2015-01-27T19:09:18.112Z\"^^&lt;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; .\r\n}\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>Does not seem to affect Containers.  Non-date properties seem to be safe, as well.</p>",
